", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o5-rShwIxXsQ7kNvwF1x3zm&_nc_oc=Adp2GbTjNGkkChU3raueGGLp-Q8k0Tdo8TCGiaqgT9qAybK97rXUR6kUcdDG_pWhh3o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7lMYMlh3LiWl42KoCHmHFLLY5CvC_eSc_eCYBWH2g9xg&oe=6A09C4F9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RYCtmVo95l0Q7kNvwFz_ZaT&_nc_oc=AdqcCsmGSdcVLhTW6PKNUe-WO1vhsFQHlyejP88ULFFd5_FtRKHtv3MF_ozRbygwk64&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af642bsUeY6h1UScSRzxIvXOJCdZ8AsGBSkVDApUkE4uOQ&oe=6A09DBCB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9RbLN_VrbK8Q7kNvwGpbgsA&_nc_oc=AdpztBM1hRyMS6IqmvF4oCIZfwNlMxXoMa4lwRKabzrjDuttuvb_TcLxm_1ogyLxCkQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4flp-fT1I4HtuP3D_Z2Y0cR0zNnEgtWitRWjALUBsG5Q&oe=6A09DA4E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel